<title>THAILAND: Grains November discharge schedule at Thai ports.</title>
<headline>Grains November discharge schedule at Thai ports.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following ships are scheduled to arrive at Thai ports for discharges in November, according to independent surveyors.</p>
<p>Vessel	    Arrival	 Commodity	     Quantity (tns)</p>
<p>Norhten Light   8/11/96	ARG  soymeal		25,193</p>
<p>Kavo Kaliakra  10/11/96	BRZ soy pellets	   53,789</p>
<p>Vega T	   23/11/96	BRZ soymeal		 20,000</p>
<p>Toscana	  25/11/96	ARG/BRZ soymeal	   45,000</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
